{"version":1,"content":"<p>成龍兒子房祖名（Jaycee）自2014年演藝事業停擺後，近年生活極為低調、絕迹幕前。</p><p>日前，日本神級製錶師中島正晴（Masaharu Nakajima）在社交平台分享多張合照，令久未露面的房祖名意外曝光近況。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:11:49.037914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:01:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:17.745742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:17.745742+00:00","content_hash":"5f38dfcf3ab16e6fdccc1f250f10f074668500e1c92891e7328616d49c256e40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}